# tgrep

This Cloud Agent environment has [Microsoft tgrep](https://github.com/microsoft/tgrep) installed. `tgrep serve` watches `/workspace` and keeps a trigram index warm.

Prefer `tgrep` over the built-in Grep tool, `rg`, and `grep` for repository searches.

```bash
tgrep "pattern" /workspace
tgrep "TODO|FIXME" /workspace -t ts
tgrep "createTask" /workspace -l
tgrep "pattern" /workspace -C 3
tgrep --files /workspace -t ts
tgrep status /workspace
```

The client auto-connects to the running server. Do not pass `--no-index` unless debugging the index.
